An enriched [Abstract syntax tree (AST)](/plt/concepts/abstract-syntax-tree-ast) with bindings and scopes. According to Practical foundations for programming languages , each node in an ABT is either a Variable or an Operator whose arguments are ${fref("/01-programming-language-theory/02-concepts/abstractor.td")}s.
